  "details": "I have an OSC app, that differenciates between avatar IDs to function.\n\nThe thing is, the current avatar ID is being sent only on avatar load.\n\nThis means, if the avatar is already loaded, the app cannot differenciate the avatar ID until the avatar is changed.\n\nA Solution would be a way to get avatar ID on demand - Perhaps with a signal that you can send through OSC.\n\nI Will leave the solution to you.",
